Natalia is one of the three people who run [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]], and a true believer in the message of the [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oreskian]] government. She lives in the base's residences, in one of three small houses under a looping sky. She keeps two books she does not carry with her: one a work on the theory of magic, and the other a fairy tale, The Fairy Tale Dog, the story of two children lost in the woods who spend it fearing the old man in the hut means to eat them, and find that he only means to care for them.
